'NO-COMPILE
' Spread only: an array is not accepted where a variadic function expects its elements. An embedder
' who wants to pass an array declares an array parameter instead.
' ERROR: CONCAT takes STRING for 'parts', but was given STRING[]
' LINE: 9
PROGRAM P
    DECLARE parts[2] STRING
    DECLARE s STRING
    s = CONCAT(parts)
    ASSERT "unreachable", s = ""
END.
